<view class="placeholder">
  <view class="placeholder-title">全库搜索</view>
  <view class="placeholder-body">桌面版用 SQLite FTS5 建索引；移动端改用内存索引，实测 7467 条文档建索引约 10ms，性能充足。</view>
</view>

<view class="section">
  <view class="section-head">
    <text class="section-title">计划中的能力</text>
    <text class="section-hint">待实现</text>
  </view>
  <view class="planned-list">
    <view class="planned-item" wx:for="{{planned}}" wx:key="*this">
      <view class="planned-dot"></view>
      <text class="planned-text">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
